cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use AgentSociety, please cite the relevant paper(s).
  Prefer AgentSociety 2 when using the current platform (agentsociety2);
  cite AgentSociety (v1) when referring to the original large-scale city simulator.
  Machine-readable BibTeX is in citations.bib.
type: software
title: AgentSociety
abstract: >-
  AgentSociety is a framework for building LLM-based agent simulations in urban
  environments and research workflows. AgentSociety 2 is the recommended
  LLM-native platform; AgentSociety 1.x is the legacy city simulation package.
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/tsinghua-fib-lab/AgentSociety"
